   $q$What does the magpie's final action most strongly suggest?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She is clearing space to record what she owes the wren.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She has run out of room to make new marks on the bark.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"She has decided to stop treating kindness as a debt.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She is angry that the birds did not repay her fully.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She has decided to stop treating kindness as a debt.$q$, $q$After gifts that "nobody counted" finish her nest, she erases her record of debts, showing she has learned the wren's way. The finished nest shows she was helped beyond what was owed, so anger does not fit.$q$, 'draft', '5022d12f-ce7f-5865-841f-2b29f7d165d3')
