   $q$According to the passage, why did Nadia begin visiting her grandfather every Sunday?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To help him take care of his tomato plants","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"To look through his old photo albums with him","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"To teach him to make video calls on his new tablet","is_correct":true},{"text":"To practice for a technology class at school","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To teach him to make video calls on his new tablet$q$, $q$The first paragraph says she came "to teach her grandfather how to use the tablet" so he could call Aunt Rania. The photo albums became part of the visits later; they were not the reason she started coming.$q$, 'draft', 'f4c42000-e62e-5d28-9ec4-66a595b9f8e0')
